{"path":"container/stack/top","title":"std::stack<T,Container>::top","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::stack&lt;T,Container&gt;::</span>top","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/stack/top","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns reference to the top element in the stack. This is the most recently pushed element. This element will be removed on a call to pop().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">reference top<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_reference top<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns reference to the top element in the stack. This is the most recently pushed element. This element will be removed on a call to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack/pop\">pop()</a></span>. Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack#Member_objects\"><code>c</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">.<span class=\"me1\">back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reference to the last element.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stack&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> reportStackSize<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack\"><span class=\"kw1305\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stack</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" elements on stack<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> reportStackTop<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack\"><span class=\"kw1305\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stack</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Leaves element on stack</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Top element: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">top</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack\"><span class=\"kw1305\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stack</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">push</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">push</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">push</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">51</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    reportStackSize<span class=\"br0\">(</span>s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    reportStackTop<span class=\"br0\">(</span>s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    reportStackSize<span class=\"br0\">(</span>s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">pop</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    reportStackSize<span class=\"br0\">(</span>s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    reportStackTop<span class=\"br0\">(</span>s<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>3 elements on stack\nTop element: 51\n3 elements on stack\n2 elements on stack\nTop element: 6</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack/push\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts element at the top <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/stack/pop\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>pop</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  removes the top element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/stack","title":"std::stack"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::stack<T,Container>::top","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Returns reference to the top element in the stack. This is the most recently pushed element."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Reference to the last element."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"push","note":"inserts element at the top"},{"label":"pop","note":"removes the top element"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":139,"codeBlockCount":2}
